<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">Filimon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Filimon Maants</para>
  <para style="toc3">Film.</para>
  <para style="mt3">Wosheetso P'awlos Wosho</para>
  <para style="mt">Filimon Maants</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Filimon daneek krstiyaniya b́tesh, K'olasiyas Ik'i mootsi ashe b́teshok'o danofaletuwe. Filimon Onismosi eteets guutso detsfe b́tesh, guutsanúwere b́doonzoke t'aft bíamtsok'oon tipimootse teshtso P'awlosnton b́gonkeyi, P'awlos weeron Onismos krstiyani wotat bíamani, P'awlos Filimon maants b́ guut'ts wosho filimon b́maants aanar woke fa'a guutsonton b́maneetuwok'o gawitka b́tesh, manats dabtuwere and Onisimos krstiyani b́wottsotse haniyere hakon krstiyani eshuwok'o bín b́dek'etuwok'owa bako guutsok'o b́taawurawok'owe bísh b́keewiri.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1-3</para>
  <para style="io1">P'awlos udo Filimonsh 4-7</para>
  <para style="io1">P'awlos Onosimos jango b́ t'intsts kup'ts k'ono 8-22</para>
  <para style="io1">Gúúpo 23-25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="s">Jamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Krstos Iyesus jangosh tipetso tiyoke P'awlosnat no eshu T'imotiyosokere, shunetso no eshuu no fini tooh wottsosh Filimonsh, <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:17">K'ol. 4:17</ref> </char></note> no mish Afbyash noonton Krstossh kaarts wottsosh Arikip'assh, mank'owere n meyits ko'eyiru amantsuwotssh, <verse eid="PHM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>No nihi Ik'oke, no doonz Iyesus Krstos s'aatetonat jeenon itsh wotowe.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Filimon shunonat imnetiyon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Ik'o tk'onor itn gawfetsat jam aawo Izar Izeweri udirwe, <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>Doonzo Iyesussh n detsts shunonat imnetiyon ando amantsuwotssh shuno n detstsok'o shishre, <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Krstosk no wottsosh no detsts sheeng keew jamo keer b́ danetwok'o n imnetiyo k'oshwotssh kayiyosh n kúp'itwok'o Ik'o k'onitwe. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Ti eshuwo! niatse tuutson amantsuwots nibo b́ handrtsosh n shuno een wotts gene'onat kúp'o taash imre.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Onesimos jangosh Filimoni b́k'ontsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>K'alo neesh b́geyitwo k'alwe err neen azazosh Krstosn ááw shuuk'o tdetsalor, <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>mank'o k'aloniyere Krstos Iyesus jangosh tipetso taa eenasho P'awlos shunon k'ono marat'itwe. <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:9">K'ol. 4:9</ref> </char></note> taa tipi mootse t beyor Shayiron t naayi wottso Onesimos jangosh neen k'onre. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Onasimos haniyere shin k'awntsalke b́ teshi, andomo taash wotowa neeshor t'ak'amitke.<verse eid="PHM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Hambe bín niyok aanidek' woshere, bín niyok twoshoor t took níbo twoshtsok'o woshde'er taawitwe. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Doo shishi jangosh hanokere tipeyat t beyor n shegro wotar taash b́ finish bí taanton b́wotink'e geneúyank'ee b́ teshi, <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Ernmó n sheeng fino angnon b́ woterawo shunon b́ wotituwok'owa etaat nee niekeraniyere eegoru k'alo geeratse.<verse eid="PHM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Onesimos andish b́ borfetso múk' gizewosh niyatse b́k'ale daneraka haniyere hakon jam gizeyosh neenton beyosh wotituwe. <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>Haniyak guutsok'o b́ woterawo guutsoniyere bog wotar shuneets eshúwok'owiye, bí taash shuneets eeshúwe, neeshmó iki bogo aaw aawi b́ beyonat doonzon shune eshwok'oyiye.<verse eid="PHM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Eshe taanton tohaat finef tohok'o woshdek'at tawurne wotiyal arikon taank'o woshde'er bín de'e. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Neen b́ dadtso fa'e wotiyal wee k'awntso biyatse fa'e wotiyal b́ k'awntsman tiyats woshuwe. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Eshe taa P'awlos «Bíyatse fa'a k'awntso dashetwe» etaat t took kishon t guut'tsok'o danire, ernmó n kashosh nee n tookon dab taash k'awnts n wottsok'o taa neesh t gawiyo geyiratse. <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Eshe tí eshwo! sheeng keewan taash n k'alitwok'o doozon neen k'onirwe oona neesha t nibo Krstosn taash handriwe.<verse eid="PHM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Neesh t guut'tsansh taash ni'alletwok'o amanere, monk'owere taa ti aattsoniyere bogo n k'alituwok'o danfee. <verse eid="PHM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Mannowere Ik'o it k'ono shiyir itok t weetwok'o b́ woshitwok'o t tewnirwotse bíts t kashit moo taash k'aniwe.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'uwaatsi jamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="COL 1:7">K'ol. 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:12">4:12</ref> </char>
    </note> Krstos Iyesus jangosh taanton tipetso Ep'afra jamo itsh t'intsirwe, <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Wosh. 12:12</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:29">19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">K'ol. 4:10</ref>, <ref loc="COL 4:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10-11">2 T'im. 4:10-11</ref> </char></note> Mank'owere t fini tooh wottswots Mark'os, Arst'rokos, Demas, Luk'aswere jamo neesh t'intsirune.<verse eid="PHM 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Doonzo Iyesus Krstos s'aato it Shayironton wotowe.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
